dist
src/convex/_generated

# Secrets never belong in the repository. Values are held in the platform's
# Keys / API keys UI and injected into the deployment as environment secrets,
# which is why nothing under src/ reads a key from the client bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
service-account.json
